window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A Fae determined to recover her memory and learn her place in the realm discovers that there are no simple answers.</p> <p>With the help of a soldier with secrets of his own, she charts a course between two worlds, a dark forest where no Fae dare set foot, and the capital of the realm, which might end up being more deadly.</p> <p>Can she uncover her identity before the rest of the realm's secrets pull her into something she can't talk or fight her way out of?</p> <p>Fae Wilds series:</p> <ul> <li><i>Twist &amp; Turns</i></li> <li><i>Curse of the Fae</i></li> <li><i>Force the Truth</i></li> <li><i>Crown &amp; Glory</i></li> <li><i>Enemy &amp; Rivals</i></li> <li><i>Light in the Dark</i></li> </ul> <p><i>USA Today</i> best-selling author W.J. May creates a new paranormal series with a world of Fae and magic. Escape into a realm of fantasy creatures, love and deception, betrayal and jealousy.</p>"; 
